{"application": "datastet", "version": "0.8.1", "date": "2026-05-30T16:58+0000", "md5": "9ED5F64A7E19D185D69DB64F97BC9382", "pages": [{"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}, {"page_height": 792.0, "page_width": 612.0}], "mentions": [{"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 113, "offsetEnd": 121, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 265.051, "y": 289.63, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "We trained a large, deep convolutional neural network to classify the 1.2 million high-resolution images in the ImageNet LSVRC-2010 contest into the 1000 dif- ferent classes.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.03171808645129204}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.000345996959367767}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "GPU", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GPU", "normalizedForm": "GPU", "offsetStart": 79, "offsetEnd": 82, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 401.737, "y": 355.383, "w": 19.9252, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "GPU", "context": "To make train- ing faster, we used non-saturating neurons and a very efficient GPU implemen- tation of the convolution operation.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9566261768341064}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.04312729835510254}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.00024650414707139134}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9566261768341064}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7774905562400818}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.7175620198249817}}}, {"rawForm": "NORB", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "NORB", "normalizedForm": "NORB", "offsetStart": 118, "offsetEnd": 122, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 342.22, "y": 509.179, "w": 27.6761, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "NORB", "context": "Until recently, datasets of labeled images were relatively small -on the order of tens of thousands of images (e.g., NORB , Caltech-101/256 , and CIFAR-10/100 ).", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9929225444793701}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.005038637667894363}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0020389859564602375}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9929225444793701}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.005038637667894363}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0020389859564602375}}, "references": [{"label": "[16]", "normalizedForm": "[16]", "refKey": 15, "offsetStart": 1666, "offsetEnd": 1670, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 372.427, "y": 509.179, "w": 15.270640000000014, "h": 8.63760000000002}]}]}, {"rawForm": "Caltech-101/256", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "Caltech-101/256", "normalizedForm": "Caltech-101/256", "offsetStart": 125, "offsetEnd": 140, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 394.046, "y": 509.179, "w": 66.41070000000002, "h": 8.63760000000002}]}, "normalizedForm": "Caltech-101/256", "context": "Until recently, datasets of labeled images were relatively small -on the order of tens of thousands of images (e.g., NORB , Caltech-101/256 , and CIFAR-10/100 ).", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9929225444793701}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.005038637667894363}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0020389859564602375}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9929225444793701}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.005038637667894363}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0020389859564602375}}, "references": [{"label": "[8,", "normalizedForm": "[8", "refKey": 7, "offsetStart": 1688, "offsetEnd": 1694, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 462.977, "y": 509.179, "w": 20.502999999999986, "h": 8.63760000000002}]}, {"label": "9]", "normalizedForm": "9]", "refKey": 8, "offsetStart": 1688, "offsetEnd": 1694, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 462.977, "y": 509.179, "w": 20.502999999999986, "h": 8.63760000000002}]}]}, {"rawForm": "CIFAR-10/100", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "CIFAR-10/100", "normalizedForm": "CIFAR-10/100", "offsetStart": 148, "offsetEnd": 160, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 108.0, "y": 520.138, "w": 59.596300000000014, "h": 8.63760000000002}]}, "normalizedForm": "CIFAR-10/100", "context": "Until recently, datasets of labeled images were relatively small -on the order of tens of thousands of images (e.g., NORB , Caltech-101/256 , and CIFAR-10/100 ).", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9929225444793701}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.005038637667894363}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0020389859564602375}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9929225444793701}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.005038637667894363}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0020389859564602375}}}, {"rawForm": "MNIST", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MNIST", "normalizedForm": "MNIST", "offsetStart": 49, "offsetEnd": 54, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 197.195, "y": 542.056, "w": 30.9936, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "MNIST", "context": "For example, the current- best error rate on the MNIST digit-recognition task (<0.3%) approaches human performance .", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8256404995918274}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.13634642958641052}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.03801316022872925}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8256404995918274}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.13634642958641052}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.03801316022872925}}}, {"rawForm": "LabelMe", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "LabelMe", "normalizedForm": "LabelMe", "offsetStart": 32, "offsetEnd": 39, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 419.44, "y": 585.891, "w": 35.965, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "LabelMe", "context": "The new larger datasets include LabelMe , which consists of hundreds of thousands of fully-segmented images, and ImageNet , which consists of over 15 million labeled high-resolution images in over 22,000 categories.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.00706594018265605}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.015653124079108238}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.00706594018265605}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.015653124079108238}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 114, "offsetEnd": 122, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 375.346, "y": 596.85, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "The new larger datasets include LabelMe , which consists of hundreds of thousands of fully-segmented images, and ImageNet , which consists of over 15 million labeled high-resolution images in over 22,000 categories.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.00706594018265605}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.015653124079108238}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 139, "offsetEnd": 147, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 1, "x": 320.781, "y": 646.663, "w": 37.13173333333334, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "However, the immense complexity of the object recognition task means that this prob- lem cannot be specified even by a dataset as large as ImageNet, so our model should also have lots of prior knowledge to compensate for all the data we don't have.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.0938776433467865}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.8526859283447266}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.053436409682035446}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 195, "offsetEnd": 203, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 464.72, "y": 118.215, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "Luck- ily, current GPUs, paired with a highly-optimized implementation of 2D convolution, are powerful enough to facilitate the training of interestingly-large CNNs, and recent datasets such as ImageNet contain enough labeled examples to train such models without severe overfitting.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.02248375304043293}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.918769896030426}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0587463416159153}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 144, "offsetEnd": 152, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 276.836, "y": 157.069, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "The specific contributions of this paper are as follows: we trained one of the largest convolutional neural networks to date on the subsets of ImageNet used in the ILSVRC-2010 and ILSVRC-2012 competitions and achieved by far the best results ever reported on these datasets.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.3482585549354553}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.6419834494590759}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.00975796114653349}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 0, "offsetEnd": 8, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 108.0, "y": 373.002, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "ImageNet is a dataset of over 15 million labeled high-resolution images belonging to roughly 22,000 categories.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.3096355199813843}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.40253812074661255}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "images", "type": "dataset-implicit", "dataset-implicit": {"rawForm": "images", "normalizedForm": "images", "offsetStart": 4, "offsetEnd": 10, "bestDataType": "image", "bestTypeScore": 0.8305, "hasDataset": 0.9999952912330627, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 175.586, "y": 383.961, "w": 28.224, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "images", "context": "The images were collected from the web and labeled by human labelers using Ama- zon's Mechanical Turk crowd-sourcing tool.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9999629855155945}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 2.664619023562409e-05}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 1.0195749382546637e-05}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 99, "offsetEnd": 107, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 289.588, "y": 405.879, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "Starting in 2010, as part of the Pascal Visual Object Challenge, an annual competition called the ImageNet Large-Scale Visual Recognition Challenge (ILSVRC) has been held.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.25912049412727356}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.4950326383113861}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2458467185497284}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 24, "offsetEnd": 32, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 315.7, "y": 416.838, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "ILSVRC uses a subset of ImageNet with roughly 1000 images in each of 1000 categories.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.873473584651947}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.07198437303304672}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.05454203858971596}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "ILSVRC-2010", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ILSVRC-2010", "normalizedForm": "ILSVRC-2010", "offsetStart": 0, "offsetEnd": 11, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 108.0, "y": 455.692, "w": 58.66980000000001, "h": 8.63760000000002}]}, "normalizedForm": "ILSVRC-2010", "context": "ILSVRC-2010 is the only version of ILSVRC for which the test set labels are available, so this is the version on which we performed most of our experiments.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.20454208552837372}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.23626106977462769}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.5591968297958374}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.20454208552837372}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.23626106977462769}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.5591968297958374}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 3, "offsetEnd": 11, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 304.123, "y": 488.569, "w": 37.13173333333334, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "On ImageNet, it is customary to report two error rates: top-1 and top-5, where the top-5 error rate is the fraction of test images for which the correct label is not among the five labels considered most probable by the model.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.23679277300834656}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.6111651659011841}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.1520419865846634}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "ImageNet", "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "offsetStart": 0, "offsetEnd": 8, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 2, "x": 108.0, "y": 527.423, "w": 39.2825, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "ImageNet", "context": "ImageNet consists of variable-resolution images, while our system requires a constant input dimen- sionality.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.12763255834579468}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7952142357826233}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.07715312391519547}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9679357409477234}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9772810339927673}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2878263294696808}}}, {"rawForm": "CIFAR-10", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "CIFAR-10", "normalizedForm": "CIFAR-10", "offsetStart": 115, "offsetEnd": 123, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 410.18, "y": 296.572, "w": 37.69470000000001, "h": 7.773900000000026}]}, "normalizedForm": "CIFAR-10", "context": "Figure : A four-layer convolutional neural  network with ReLUs (solid line) reaches a 25% training error rate on CIFAR-10 six times faster than an equivalent network with tanh neurons (dashed line).", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.7566444873809814}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.17310339212417603}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.07025212794542313}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.7566444873809814}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.17310339212417603}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.07025212794542313}}}, {"rawForm": "CIFAR-10 \\ndataset", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "CIFAR-10 \ndataset", "normalizedForm": "CIFAR-10 dataset", "offsetStart": 117, "offsetEnd": 134, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 282.076, "y": 230.1, "w": 41.88280000000003, "h": 8.637599999999992}, {"p": 3, "x": 108.0, "y": 241.059, "w": 27.6661, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "CIFAR-10 dataset", "context": "This is demonstrated in Figure , which shows the number of iterations re- quired to reach 25% training error on the CIFAR-10 dataset for a particular four-layer convolutional net- work.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9682818055152893}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.030262138694524765}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.001456136000342667}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9987667798995972}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.030262138694524765}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.001456136000342667}}}, {"rawForm": "Caltech-101 dataset", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "Caltech-101 dataset", "normalizedForm": "Caltech-101 dataset", "offsetStart": 186, "offsetEnd": 205, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 108.0, "y": 356.626, "w": 77.8432, "h": 8.63760000000002}]}, "normalizedForm": "Caltech-101 dataset", "context": "For example, Jarrett et al. claim that the nonlinearity f (x) = |tanh(x)| works particularly well with their type of contrast nor- malization followed by local average pooling on the Caltech-101 dataset.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9228450655937195}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.06581514328718185}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.011339761316776276}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9228450655937195}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.06581514328718185}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.011339761316776276}}}, {"rawForm": "GPU", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GPU", "normalizedForm": "GPU", "offsetStart": 17, "offsetEnd": 20, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 184.871, "y": 469.869, "w": 19.9252, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "GPU", "context": "A single GTX 580 GPU has only 3GB of memory, which limits the maximum size of the networks that can be trained on it.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.42655956745147705}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.315626859664917}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.25781363248825073}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9566261768341064}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7774905562400818}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.7175620198249817}}}, {"rawForm": "GPU", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GPU", "normalizedForm": "GPU", "offsetStart": 110, "offsetEnd": 113, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 232.014, "y": 491.786, "w": 16.811925000000002, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "GPU", "context": "It turns out that 1.2 million training examples are enough to train networks which are too big to fit on one GPU.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.49423226714134216}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.43506211042404175}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.07070556282997131}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9566261768341064}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7774905562400818}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.7175620198249817}}}, {"rawForm": "GPU", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GPU", "normalizedForm": "GPU", "offsetStart": 52, "offsetEnd": 55, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 258.3679333333333, "y": 502.745, "w": 14.571966666666665, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "GPU", "context": "Current GPUs are particularly well-suited to cross-GPU parallelization, as they are able to read from and write to one another's memory directly, without going through host machine memory.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.17808492481708527}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7250679135322571}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.09684721380472183}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9566261768341064}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7774905562400818}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.7175620198249817}}}, {"rawForm": "GPU", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GPU", "normalizedForm": "GPU", "offsetStart": 101, "offsetEnd": 104, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 442.324, "y": 524.663, "w": 16.81185, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "GPU", "context": "The parallelization scheme that we employ essentially puts half of the kernels (or neurons) on each GPU, with one additional trick: the GPUs communicate only in certain layers.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.20406107604503632}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7774905562400818}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.01844826340675354}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9566261768341064}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7774905562400818}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.7175620198249817}}}, {"rawForm": "GPU", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GPU", "normalizedForm": "GPU", "offsetStart": 202, "offsetEnd": 205, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 381.154, "y": 557.54, "w": 16.81185, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "GPU", "context": "This means that, for example, the kernels of layer 3 take input from all kernel maps in layer 2. However, kernels in layer 4 take input only from those kernel maps in layer 3 which reside on the same GPU.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.5461452603340149}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.35256683826446533}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.10128791630268097}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9566261768341064}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7774905562400818}, "shared": {"value": true, "score": 0.7175620198249817}}}, {"rawForm": "GPU", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GPU", "normalizedForm": "GPU", "offsetStart": 178, "offsetEnd": 181, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 3, "x": 312.323, "y": 629.271, "w": 16.81185, "h": 8.6376}]}, "normalizedForm": "GPU", "context": "This scheme reduces our top-1 and top-5 error rates by 1.7% and 1.2%, respectively, 